            "paragraph": "The plausibility of the simulated climates is assessed by comparing relative changes in seven-year DJF distributions of precipitable water (PW), integrated vapour transport (IVT) and precipitation between the Counterfactual and Actual simulations against corresponding Past and Present periods in ERA5.",
