            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "The temporal evolution of precipitable water (PW), integrated vapour transport (IVT), and mean sea level pressure (MSLP) over the days of the storm, along with the cumulative precipitation are used to validate the results of the Actual storyline scenario.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
